# 🤖 AI Code Review GitHub Action for C# — Complete Project Guide

## ✅ Project Status: COMPLETE

All code has been created and is ready to deploy. Here's everything you need.

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
Github/
├── .github/workflows/review.yml     ← GitHub Action (auto-triggers on PR)
├── scripts/
│   ├── __init__.py                   ← Package marker
│   ├── review.py                     ← Main orchestrator (entry point)
│   ├── diff_parser.py                ← Fetches & parses PR diff (C# only)
│   ├── ai_reviewer.py                ← Groq AI integration
│   └── github_commenter.py           ← Posts comments to PR
├── samples/
│   ├── UserService.cs                ← Sample C# with bugs (for demo)
│   └── OrderService.cs               ← Sample C# with bugs (for demo)
├── .gitignore
├── LICENSE
├── README.md                         ← Full documentation
├── prompts.md                        ← Prompt documentation (MANDATORY)
├── requirements.txt                  ← Python deps
└── test_local.py                     ← Local test script
```

