## 💬 Judge Q&A Preparation

**Q: Why AI?**
> Reduces review time from hours to seconds. Catches issues humans miss consistently.

**Q: Why GitHub Action?**
> Fits directly into existing developer workflow. Zero friction — just open a PR.

**Q: What capability requirement did you satisfy?**
> External API Integration — Google Gemini API for AI analysis + GitHub REST API for automation.

**Q: How is AI used?**
> AI analyzes changed C# code against 7 categories (SOLID, null handling, async, security, performance, exceptions, quality) and generates structured review feedback with severity classification and fix suggestions.

**Q: What business value?**
> Faster reviews (seconds vs hours), consistent quality standards, fewer bugs in production, reduced senior engineer bottleneck.

---

## ⚠️ Troubleshooting

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| Action doesn't trigger | Make sure `.github/workflows/review.yml` is on the `main` branch |
| "Missing API key" error | Add `GEMINI_API_KEY` secret in repo Settings → Secrets |
| No comments posted | Check if PR has `.cs` file changes |
| Inline comments fail | This is normal if line numbers don't match diff — summary comment still posts |
| Rate limited | Gemini free tier has limits — wait and retry |
